<title>UK: National Bank New Zealand sets $250 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>National Bank New Zealand sets $250 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NATIONAL BANK OF NEW ZEALAND INTL LTD (HONG KONG)</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    08.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    08.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  99.945    FULL FEES   0.125</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA-	 REOFFER    99.945</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS US/UK/HK/SI</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH    MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.075</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
